            <p class="mk-exp-sub">每次修復服務以了解你的身體開始，以你帶走修復知識結束。</p>
            <div class="mk-steps">
                <div class="mk-step">
                    <div class="mk-step-num">01</div>
                    <h4 class="mk-step-title">身體評估</h4>
                    <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-01-consult.jpg?v=3" alt="身體評估" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-step">
                    <div class="mk-step-num">02</div>
                    <h4 class="mk-step-title">問題定位</h4>
                    <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-02-measure.jpg?v=3" alt="問題定位" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-step">
                    <div class="mk-step-num">03</div>
                    <h4 class="mk-step-title">手技修復</h4>
                    <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-03-stretch.jpg?v=3" alt="手技修復" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-step">
                    <div class="mk-step-num">04</div>
                    <h4 class="mk-step-title">維護建議</h4>
                    <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-04-advice.jpg?v=3" alt="維護建議" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</template>
</data></odoo>
